  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Bureau - &quot;SDG&apos;s in your hands&quot; , since 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to utilize the &quot;Youth Bureau&apos;s&quot; (Ungdoms bureauet)  expertise and capacity to engage students from vocational schools (age 15-25) in debates and workshops related to development cooperation and the SDG global goals. 

By gaining knowledge about Danish Development Assistance the youth strengthens their democratic self-confidence and can contribute to spread public support for development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
